1 Overview
1.1 Purpose
Purpose of this documentation is to share the key operational processes in DMVIC and where all the operational processes are accessible via API. It is very important for each Member company to identify the operational processes for which they will be using APIs. DMVIC API listings with AKI Member company technical personnel such that the potential system integrations with Member Company core systems can be planned and implemented.

1.2 Audience
Primary audience is as below:

AKI personnel
Technical committee for DMVIC implementation
Technical personnel at each of the AKI Member companies
