100	Comprehensive (COMP)
200	Third-party (TPO)
300	Third-party, Theft & Fire (TPTF)
Type of Cover is not valid
4	Policyholder	Yes	string		
5	policynumber	Yes	string		
6	Commencingdate	Yes	string	DD/MM/YYYY	
1	Commencing Date is invalid
2	For the below types certificate cannot be issued with future dates Type-A Matatu, Type-A Bus. You cannot issue Future date.Kindly change dates
7	Expiringdate	Yes	string	DD/MM/YYYY	
8	Registrationnumber	No	string		
9	Chassisnumber	Yes	string		The chassis number minimum length is 4 and maximum length is 20. Only accepts alphanumeric characters and does not support any special characters
10	Phonenumber	Yes	string	999999999	Please enter a valid Kenyan number
11	Bodytype	Yes	string		
12	Licensedtocarry	Yes	int		
13	Vehiclemake	No	string		
14	Vehiclemodel	No	string		
15	Yearofregistration	Yes	int	
YYYY

16	Enginenumber	No	string		
17	Email	Yes	string	<<Email id to which the Certificate pdf will be sent on successful Issuance>>	Email is not valid
18	SumInsured	Yes (when Comprehensive (COMP) & Third-party, Theft & Fire (TPTF))	int		
New19	InsuredPIN	Yes	string		Insured PIN number maximum length is 11
New20	Yearofmanufacture	No	int	YYYY	
New21	HudumaNumber	No	string	123456789012	
